        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4em",
          "text": "If you get involved in a side-impact car accident, it is important to understand your rights and legal options. The other driver involved may have to pay for your damages and losses under Colorado’s fault-based car insurance law. Work with a skilled ",
          "marks": []
        },
