      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4fl",
          "text": "These injuries can lead to expensive medical costs, pain, suffering, lost wages and property damage. T-bone accidents can also be deadly for one or more people involved. If you lose a loved one in a fatal side-impact crash in Denver, you may be eligible for financial compensation through a ",
          "marks": []
        },
