      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4gd",
          "text": "If a driver is negligent, or fails to act with proper care, he or she can be held responsible for causing a related T-bone accident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4gh",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4gg",
          "text": "Proving Fault for a Side-Impact Accident in Denver",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4gj",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4gi",
          "text": "The responsible party in a side-impact accident is typically the driver who acted negligently or broke a traffic law. If you are the plaintiff in a T-bone accident claim, you must prove that the other driver is at fault using evidence.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4go",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l4gl",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://dmv.colorado.gov/report-accident#:~:text=How%20do%20I%20get%20a%20copy%20of%20a%20crash%20report%20for%20a%20crash%20I%20was%20involved%20in%3F"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4gk",
          "text": "Evidence may include a ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4gm",
          "text": "police accident report",
          "marks": [
            "l4gl"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4gn",
          "text": ", eyewitness statements, photographs or camera footage, physical evidence from the scene, your medical records, and expert testimony. A lawyer can help you gather evidence to prove your case and maximize your financial recovery.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4gq",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4gp",
          "text": "How Can a Denver Side-Impact Accident Lawyer Help?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4gv",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l4gs",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/contact/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4gr",
          "text": "Side-impact accidents can change lives. If you get injured or lose a loved one in this type of crash in Denver, protect yourself by hiring a car accident lawyer. Your lawyer can advocate for you during insurance settlement negotiations or bring your case to trial, if necessary, for a case outcome that can help you move forward with confidence. Begin your case with a free evaluation with a local lawyer. ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4gt",
          "text": "Contact Dormer Harpring",
          "marks": [
            "l4gs"
          ]
